menu__root["BC-250 GPU driver and game upscalers<br/>Manage RADV, FSR4, experimental HelixSR, native mesh, and migration cleanup."]:::root
menu__helixsr["HelixSR v1.2.0 (experimental)<br/>Prepare and manage the user-local HelixSR payload. Do not use injected DLLs with anti-cheat games."]:::menu
action__status["Status overview<br/>Verify the patched AMDGPU module, scheduler policy, RADV runtime, and global activation."]:::read_only
action__fsr4_dll["Install FSR4 RC9 game DLL (recommended)<br/>Portable FSR4 route. Replaces one exact existing DLL and retains the original; no custom RADV installation is needed."]:::install
action__helixsr_status["HelixSR payload status<br/>Check whether the pinned v1.2.0 payload is prepared and valid."]:::read_only
action__helixsr_prepare["Prepare HelixSR payload<br/>Download and generate the user-local payload, optionally using a local DLSS DLL. NVIDIA-derived files are not redistributed."]:::experimental
action__helixsr_install["Install HelixSR game DLL<br/>Experimental: replace an existing lowercase amd_fidelityfx_upscaler_dx12.dll or amd_fidelityfx_dx12.dll with verified rollback."]:::experimental
action__helixsr_uninstall["Uninstall HelixSR game DLL<br/>Restore one exact target from its verified rollback record."]:::cleanup
action__setup["Install / resume FSR4 RADV<br/>Installs AMDGPU first when needed, then builds async compute plus the FSR4 v4 driver for GE Proton."]:::install
action__native_mesh_install["Install BC250 RADV R2 (experimental)<br/>Install the verified R2 driver and patched vkd3d into a private Proton 11.0-2c copy for explicit per-game use."]:::experimental
action__native_mesh_remove["Remove BC250 RADV R2<br/>Remove R2 and its private Proton copy; preserve global RADV, the original Proton, game prefixes, and saves."]:::cleanup
action__legacy_cleanup["Older per-game setup cleanup<br/>Migration only: remove old MESA_DRICONF_EXECUTABLE_OVERRIDE and VK_ICD_FILENAMES Steam launch options, then clear their records."]:::cleanup
action__uninstall["Uninstall Mesa / RADV runtime<br/>Remove the alternate driver, ICD, and user environment generator; preserve build caches."]:::cleanup
action__help["Full help<br/>Show CLI commands, activation behavior, and upstream source."]:::read_only

